1
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:26,720
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:34,719
The Atranos Castle has been surrounded!

3
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:38,439
That dog called Imren, show yourself!

4
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:05,639
This is our last warning!

5
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:08,519
You have until sunset!

6
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:11,519
You will hand over the Castle Atranos!

7
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:15,159
And you will seek our
forgiveness for the things you did.

8
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:21,879
If you do not leave the castle,
then you will face our wrath!

9
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:26,039
Who will do that, you?

10
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:30,679
With how many alps are you
going to get over these walls?

11
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:35,799
The number of alps is not
the one that conquers castles.

12
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:40,799
We fight with our hearts!

13
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:45,479
You will learn the truth when
these walls crumble upon you!

14
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:49,799
However, it will be late for you by then!

15
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:55,999
Tell Osman, I will have each
and every one of your heads..

16
00:03:56,200 --> 00:04:00,199
..just as I did Bayindir Bey and his alps.

17
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:04,119
Atranos will be your last siege!

18
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,999
We came with peace.

19
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:10,239
We wanted you to surrender.

20
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:14,639
However, if you do not surrender, then..

21
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:18,678
..you will die hanging from this yard.

22
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:24,839
Then I will make you remember
your words, Imren Tegin!

23
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:43,639
Will Imren Tegin leave the castle to Gunduz Bey?

24
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:46,559
I know that he won't without fighting.

25
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:50,639
That is why..

26
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:54,879
I sent him to Atranos..

27
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,879
..to confuse Imren Tegin.

28
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:03,559
Whatever his response will
be, it won't change the outcome.

29
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:07,439
Atranos will be ours in the end.

30
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,679
We will have Bayindir Bey's vengeance as well.

31
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:15,119
No. States do not take revenge.

32
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:19,039
They only provide justice.

33
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:24,839
We will do so as well. However, Imren Tegin..

34
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:30,359
..will think that Gunduz Bey
came to Atranos for vengeance.

35
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:33,639
That is why his duty is at Atranos.

36
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:40,039
We will not take Atranos for vengeance.

37
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:44,039
We will not even take Atranos for now.

38
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:51,959
Because, as long as Kite is here..

39
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:55,559
..it is impossible to take Atranos.

40
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,599
Because the soldiers coming from Bursa and Iznik..

41
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:03,439
..can arrive at Atranos through Kite.

42
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,999
That is why Kite..

43
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:10,199
..is a very important location.

44
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,599
Not only Atranos..

45
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:17,759
..but Bursa and Iznik conquests are
not possible without taking Kite first.

46
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:21,399
Unless we have our banner
at Kite, we can not move.

47
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:25,999
We will have our banner.
If Allah permits, we will have our banner.

48
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:30,119
They will think that we will have Atranos first.

49
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:34,439
Howeveri we will walk to Kite first.

50
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:41,359
My Bey, this Imren Tegin will assign
a commander of his called "Levi".

51
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:45,599
I've asked around. They say he is a clever man.

52
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:49,959
They say they used to fight together.

53
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:53,239
He is skilled in sword they say.

54
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:56,759
My Bey, forgive me but..

55
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,959
..how will Kite fall..

56
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:04,719
..when all the alps and weapons are at Atranos?

57
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:19,839
Kite..

58
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:25,279
Kite is under siege for a long time already.

59
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,039
You did wrong by killing Bayindir.

60
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:53,599
-Relax.
-Don't tell me to relax.

61
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:57,639
-Osman's armies are on our gates.
-I wanted this.

62
00:07:57,760 --> 00:08:01,079
They were just overhasty.

63
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:04,199
What do you mean you wanted this?

64
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:09,079
I killed Bayindir for Osman to siege Atranos.

65
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:16,799
Now listen to me carefully,
Olivia. You will go to Osman.

66
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,919
Osman would kill me.

67
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:24,479
You will act as if you escaped the siege.

68
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:29,799
You will take your niece with you.
Since Osman's son loves your niece..

69
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:33,039
..we will use her.

70
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:35,198
From what I've heard..

71
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:41,119
..they will marry Osman's son
and Gunduz daughter to unite Kayis.

72
00:08:41,558 --> 00:08:43,599
That can not happen, Olivia.

73
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,719
How can I prevent this?

74
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:50,639
A loving man does not marry
with just his father's request.

75
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:53,479
Your niece will ensure this.

76
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:56,959
And you will earn their trust.

77
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,999
It is not possible for me to earn their trust.

78
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:05,039
They will trust you.

79
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:10,119
You will tell them that I've killed
Bayindir to lay siege upon Atranos.

80
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:14,799
When Osman comes to me with all of his forces..

81
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:18,959
..then he will face my surprise.

82
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:23,759
I will disrupt their palace so much..

83
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:27,439
..that they won't even notice their end is near.

84
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:31,039
We will send them away from these lands.

85
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:35,319
And how will you handle the siege?

86
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:38,799
Osman does not know about
the secret passages in Atranos.

87
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:43,519
I will use those passages. While
he thinks he has me surrounded..

88
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:48,479
..I will cut his veins one by one.

89
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:54,159
Which means, I am the one surrounding
him. He just doesn't know about it.

90
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:07,039
Our encampment is ready, near the Castle Kite.

91
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:10,879
Alps are waiting to attack for a while.

92
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:16,599
Uraz Bey. You will take position here.

93
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:19,479
As you command, my Bey. Alaeddin Bey..

94
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,879
My Bey.

95
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:24,439
The siege of Atranos is on your shoulders..

96
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:29,399
..until Konur Bey comes back from his duty.

97
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,079
As you command, my Bey.

98
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,799
The rest of the beys will be under your command.

99
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:41,599
-As you command, my Bey.
-Thank you. Malhun hatun..

100
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:46,399
You and Elcim Hatun will
welcome Gunduz Bey's people.

101
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:49,033
I will send the ones
that can hold a sword to

102
00:10:49,045 --> 00:10:51,679
the barracks and the
rest will go into the city.

103
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:54,839
Okay, okay.

104
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:59,839
Bala Hatun, you will stand back with Baciyans.

105
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,999
You are my secret swords.

106
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:06,319
We will stand ready, Osman Bey.

107
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,639
Thank you.

108
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:15,519
Now, it is time for Imren Tegin.

109
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:20,759
He will think we will attack Atranos.

110
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:26,559
However, with the alps of Gunduz
Bey and those from the barracks..

111
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:30,279
..we will surround Kite.

112
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:35,359
This way, they will be divided.

113
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:43,879
Soldiers won't be able to pass through here.

114
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:51,639
Then, we will already have Atranos surrounded.

115
00:11:57,200 --> 00:12:01,119
And we will make the killer of Bayindir Bey pay.

116
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,319
If Allah permits.

117
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:09,039
Atranos will be a grave to them,
and a treasure to us, my Bey.

118
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:13,359
However, first Kite.

119
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:20,919
It is. We will not be done with Kite only.

120
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:33,159
We got a message from Karesi port too. Many
Crusaders are marching towards us from there.

121
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:44,239
For this reason, Orhan Bey
and Konur Bey went to the port.

122
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:47,199
If Allah permits, they'll be back with good news.

123
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:50,319
-If Allah permits., my Bey.
-If Allah permits..

124
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:53,399
We thought we got rid of Tajeddin.

125
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:56,399
Now we have got a new trouble.

126
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:59,519
He's also calling all the jackals from the west.

127
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:03,759
Jackals can bite nobody in our land, Elcim Hatun.

128
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:09,519
Because Osman Bey is always standing.

129
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:18,999
Names change. Faces change.
But the fight never changes.

130
00:13:19,640 --> 00:13:25,119
This is the fight between the right and
the wrong. They can try whatever they want.

131
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:28,479
We will be victorious with Allah's will.

132
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:33,559
If everyone performs their duties properly,

133
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:42,359
Kite will be ours.
Atranos will be ours.

134
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:47,359
And Imren Tegin's head will be ours.

135
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:53,439
No worries. Allah is the only Victorious.

136
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:57,439
Allah is the only Victorious.

137
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:20,479
Dastards. Those hatuns are Turkish, my Shahzade.

138
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:28,559
They started doing evil
things as soon as they arrived.

139
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:35,479
Osman Bey was right.
Heathens are getting united.

140
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:39,639
They came to Karesi by the sea from the west.

141
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:47,919
We will find out why these
dastards came here, Konur Bey.

142
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,759
We have a duty.

143
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:02,799
But we don't have any duties more
important than protecting our people.

144
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:07,119
We are outnumbered.
First, we will find out...

145
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:10,559
...where they are taking those hatuns.

146
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:17,439
Varangians, come on! We're going ahead to scout!

147
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:21,479
Wolves hunt whoever leaves the herd.

148
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:29,799
Now we will see what they intend to do. Let's go.

149
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:11,919
In the war, those who
predict the enemy's moves win.

150
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:16,079
You are attacking to die!

151
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,839
Daniel.

152
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:53,199
A swords sometimes cuts the enemy
and sometimes becomes a shield.

153
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:57,679
You need to learn how to defend before you attack.

154
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:07,479
Your soldiers will be as strong as my men.

155
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:12,358
Or they are going to die.

156
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:33,519
These are the tax coins
collected to be delivered to Osman.

157
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:36,759
Two chests to soldiers and one to Imren Tegin.

158
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:50,039
Poor guys... They think they can
get rid of Osman with these gold coins.

159
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:58,159
Hand out my share to my brave fighters.

160
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:12,919
Long live Imren Tegin! Long live
Imren'Tegin! Long live Imren Tegin!

161
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:22,079
-Everything is set, Imreh Tegin.
-Good.

162
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,639
We will be careful.

163
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,799
With the newcomer soldiers,

164
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:32,679
...you will protect the castle
of Kite at the cost of your life.

165
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:36,799
Reinforcements are on the way. Treat them well.

166
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:41,159
-As you wish. I will train them.
-I know.

167
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:47,359
So your gift is on the way too. I'm
getting nice women brought for you.

168
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:08,479
Stop there. Where are you going?

169
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:45,679
I need you alive, not dead.

170
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:50,879
Tie this dog up. He knows things to tell us.

171
00:19:57,400 --> 00:20:00,399
Come on.

172
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:09,528
I knew Imren wouldn't
give away Atranos without a

173
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:12,239
fight. But I wanted him to
be sure about our move.

174
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:16,839
So I wanted you to see the situation.

175
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:21,999
Imren's soldiers are on alert and they are sharp.

176
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:26,399
Our men are on the way and they are tired.

177
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:31,439
They are, but we can beat their sharp ones easily.

178
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:34,639
Walls cannot protect them.

179
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:43,719
You trusted beys and warriors for Atranos.

180
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:47,559
Now let's talk about our part.

181
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:53,759
-How will we hunt?
-Come with me.

182
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:05,719
Alps have been watching Kite for a long time.

183
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:12,279
Everybody knows well what to do.

184
00:21:12,840 --> 00:21:17,279
We know where to attack
with catapults. We will split up.

185
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:21,799
While one wing hits the walls,

186
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,319
...the other wing will climb up the towers.

187
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:27,959
-It will be hard.
-Good. Good.

188
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:33,799
Let it be hard, Osman Bey. If it
were easy, it wouldn't be a homeland.

189
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:43,799
You say so, huh? Then Kite...

190
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:47,119
...which we take with blood and right of sword...

191
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,639
...shall be your property.

192
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:57,799
Thank you, Osman. Now you've
increased my desire to fight!

193
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:05,759
Your alps will be exhausted.

194
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:15,919
Kayi soldiers cannot be broken by exhaustion...

195
00:22:16,120 --> 00:22:19,599
...but by laziness, Osman Bey. Don't worry.

196
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:22,879
-They will fight like lions, if Allah permits.
-For sure.

197
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:34,679
-Yes, my Bey? You wanted to see me.
-Son.

198
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:38,879
You'll go to the frontier market
before the conquest of Atranos.

199
00:22:39,280 --> 00:22:42,519
Go talk to Mehmed.

200
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:48,159
Tell him we'll take Atranos. Don't
tell him the truth. I don't trust him.

201
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:52,039
-But, my Bey...
-Son.

202
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:58,879
I'm sending you there deliberately.
You'll end the hostility between you two.

203
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:04,359
Be sure whether they will back us up or
not if we face some troubles in the fight.

204
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:08,999
As you order, my Bey.

205
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:14,799
Well, Gunduz Bey... Let's go see the headquarters.

206
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:21,359
-Boran, bring the horses.
-Alright, my Bey.

207
00:23:51,280 --> 00:23:55,719
Mother... Mother.

208
00:24:03,120 --> 00:24:05,799
Mother.

209
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:13,759
I know you miss your mother.

210
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:18,359
But they became martyrs for
our homeland and our holy cause.

211
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:22,279
So we need to fight for our
cause for the sake of them.

212
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:24,799
We won't bow against anyone.

213
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:29,679
We will live for the future
of Turks in Allah's path.

214
00:24:32,120 --> 00:24:37,039
You will grow up and fight for the Islam world.

215
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:39,959
You will have many victories.

216
00:24:41,120 --> 00:24:43,919
Now wipe your tears.

217
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:50,319
Those who did this to us will cry. We won't.

218
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:59,239
See? Your brothers are there.

219
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:02,519
Take these.

220
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:11,399
Here. Go give them.

221
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:42,479
If your mother were alive,
she would be proud of you.

222
00:25:43,520 --> 00:25:46,119
May Allah make her soul rest in peace.

223
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:50,479
I've been watching you.

224
00:25:50,760 --> 00:25:54,319
I see how you are looking after your people.

225
00:25:55,120 --> 00:26:00,919
You're behaving like a true Bey's
daughter with your mind and strength.

226
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:06,759
If you see something good in
me, I took it from my parents.

227
00:26:07,520 --> 00:26:10,999
My mother told us the battles of
our ancestors instead of lullabies.

228
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:14,599
We used to close our eyes for a dream.

229
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:20,079
Red Apple... The words of Allah...

230
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:25,639
I hope our dream will be the fate of our kin.

231
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:31,159
Migration, fight, martyrdom and
longing... They are all from Him.

232
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:36,199
Praise be to you!

233
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:41,159
You're just from the blood of Mother Hayme.
Praise be, daughter!

234
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:47,679
I want it to happen, but...

235
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:52,519
...I don't know if Orhan and
you are the fate of each other.

236
00:26:54,280 --> 00:26:56,319
But I'm sure of this.

237
00:26:56,560 --> 00:27:01,239
The house you are in will always be in peace.

238
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:07,279
The man you'll marry and your
children-to-be-born are so lucky.

239
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:14,279
May you always have a good luck and fate, dear.

240
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:19,199
If Allah permits, it will be
good for both of the tribes.

241
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:22,279
If Allah permits.

242
00:27:30,520 --> 00:27:35,479
Speak... Are you serving Imren Tegin?

243
00:27:35,760 --> 00:27:37,348
Where are you going?

244
00:27:37,360 --> 00:27:40,079
We are going
to the Kite Castle.

245
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:42,639
The ones who are on the way will go to Kite.

246
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:48,679
That castle is really important for Imren
Tegin. We are going there to support them.

247
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:53,999
Of course you know...
Before taking Kite Castle...

248
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:57,119
...you cannot conquer the other ones.

249
00:27:57,760 --> 00:27:59,399
Who else will come? Tell me.

250
00:27:59,520 --> 00:28:04,399
All mercenaries in Byzantium will come. Just wait.

251
00:28:04,600 --> 00:28:07,919
-Just mercenaries?
-No.

252
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:13,399
The emperor released all the prisoners in
his lands in exchange for their fighting.

253
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:17,879
They will unite with Templars, Varangians...

254
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:22,279
...and come here with hundreds of ships.

255
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:30,039
Look at my face. What made the Emperor so angry?

256
00:28:30,560 --> 00:28:35,239
That Bey named Osman killed Princess Maria.

257
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:40,879
Thus, Emperor gave all
his soldiers to Imren Tegin.

258
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:44,559
We are just the advance force.

259
00:28:49,840 --> 00:28:55,959
-What about captive Turk women?
-They are just for entertainment.

260
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:15,599
It must be entertaining now.

261
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:20,199
Get ready. Come on.

262
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:27,159
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

263
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:34,639
So Osman Bey is surrounding Atranos, huh?
But he didn't even invite us to the council.

264
00:29:35,320 --> 00:29:40,519
-How was the council Uraz Bey?
-It was alright, Mehmet Bey.

265
00:29:40,760 --> 00:29:45,079
Osman Bey says that we should unite
because of the issue about Imren Tegin.

266
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:48,679
And... as you know, Atranos.

267
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:53,079
I know. Osman Bey will
show the power of Turks to...

268
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:57,199
...infidels by taking Atranos, huh?

269
00:29:57,360 --> 00:30:01,999
But fortunately, we are not
Osman Bey's enemies, Mehmet Bey.

270
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:04,799
His mind works differently.

271
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:10,799
Do you think Osman Bey is planning a new game?

272
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:15,359
No... I am not saying that.

273
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:19,959
I should go, if you allow me, Mehmet Bey..

274
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:23,399
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

275
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:33,119
Osman!

276
00:30:33,320 --> 00:30:35,559
Osman does not trust us, Kanyumaz.

277
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:40,239
-You are right, my Bey.
-He set up the council against Imren.

278
00:30:40,440 --> 00:30:43,719
And he warned Beys against Imren.

279
00:30:44,520 --> 00:30:48,199
Osman must have another plan other than Atranos.

280
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:54,479
No one will know that Uraz Bey came here
and what was talked about here, Kanyumaz.

281
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:57,559
-Yes my Bey.
-Go now.

282
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:06,639
OSMAN BEY KITE HEADQUARTERS

283
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:18,479
What is the situation? Tell me. I want
the preparations to be done until tomorrow.

284
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:23,239
It will be done, my Bey.
Alps, come on, do not stop!

285
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:28,039
You can even break the greatest
walls with these catapults, Osman Bey.

286
00:31:28,320 --> 00:31:34,279
Yes... But catapults won't be
enough, we will also dig beneath them.

287
00:31:35,080 --> 00:31:38,239
What is your plan, Osman Bey?

288
00:31:38,600 --> 00:31:40,799
Are the passages ready? How is it going?

289
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:44,400
Alps are digging day and night, my Bey.

290
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,400
If Allah permits, we will be
in the scorpion's nest before morning.

291
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:46,600
I don't want a single mistake.

292
00:31:46,612 --> 00:31:48,920
There won't be an accident
with Allah's consent, my Bey.

293
00:31:48,920 --> 00:31:51,759
As you ordered, we will have
everything done if Allah permits.

294
00:31:51,759 --> 00:31:54,159
Inform Alps. They have to be careful.

295
00:31:54,320 --> 00:31:58,479
Look, they are not like the other ones.
You will follow us from behind, Aykurt.

296
00:31:58,480 --> 00:32:00,479
Yes my Bey. -So...

297
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:04,439
...you are also digging a tunnel
to get in the castle, Osman Bey.

298
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:09,119
We are digging with our hands, Gunduz
Bey. We are digging with our hands.

299
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:13,359
I will hurt that Imren dog so badly that...

300
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:15,519
..he won't be able to breathe.

301
00:32:30,840 --> 00:32:34,239
Alaeddin Bey.

302
00:32:37,040 --> 00:32:40,439
What are you doing here?

303
00:32:40,760 --> 00:32:45,079
Didn't you hear my brother? If he sees you here...
-He can't do anything.

304
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:47,999
I came here with the order of Osman Bey.

305
00:32:48,200 --> 00:32:50,799
Good.

306
00:32:51,280 --> 00:32:54,719
I didn't think you came here for another reason.

307
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:58,199
Alaeddin!

308
00:33:02,280 --> 00:33:07,359
Mehmet Bey... I brought news from Osman Bey.

309
00:33:08,320 --> 00:33:11,439
He wants to talk to you.

310
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:18,119
Good then. Come to my tent.

311
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:24,199
Gonca. Come with us.

312
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:49,639
Tell me Alaeddin Bey. What does Osman Bey want?

313
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:54,959
Osman Bey surrounded Atranos
castle. Now we want to know.

314
00:33:55,200 --> 00:34:01,879
Will you stand by our side when the
time comes, or will you stand against us?

315
00:34:02,120 --> 00:34:08,719
Osman Bey set up a council.
Why didn't he invite us?

316
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:13,879
Osman Bey's own Beys were present at the council.

317
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:20,799
Did you come under our command
to be present in our council?

318
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:28,199
You are our ally Germiyan.
Now I want to hear your answer.

319
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:32,279
Are you still our ally...

320
00:34:32,440 --> 00:34:36,839
...or will you not support
Turks while they struggle?

321
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:40,918
Alaeddin Bey.

322
00:34:41,040 --> 00:34:43,518
Our issue with you is different...

323
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:48,998
...and the issue of the state is different.

324
00:34:49,440 --> 00:34:52,399
I will come whenever Osman Bey calls.

325
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:56,879
But... I will also ask for something.

326
00:34:57,240 --> 00:35:01,079
The path to strength lies in
knowing every move of your opponent.

327
00:35:01,720 --> 00:35:05,919
If you know, you can defeat them and be strong.

328
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:10,959
You will know every move of Osman.

329
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:15,359
You want me to be your spy.

330
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:18,439
I won't betray a Turk.

331
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:22,399
I don't want you to be my spy.

332
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:26,999
Just don't stand against us and disrupt our trade.

333
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:30,879
Besides, you still have to know
Osman's moves for your trades.

334
00:35:31,040 --> 00:35:35,999
After what happened, Yenisehir's
doors are closed to Germiyan.

335
00:35:36,600 --> 00:35:40,279
-I cannot approach them.
-You will.

336
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,879
What is on your mind?

337
00:35:41,891 --> 00:35:44,239
You will trade
with Osman again.

338
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:47,759
This will let you approach them.

339
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:54,639
We will trade in Yenisehir again. We
will have a counter at the marketplace.

340
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:11,759
Good. I will inform Osman
Bey about this, Mehmet Bey.

341
00:36:13,640 --> 00:36:18,919
-Now, excuse me.
-Sure. -Thank you.

342
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:38,239
Gonca! Stop.

343
00:36:41,440 --> 00:36:44,559
Were you serious about what you said?

344
00:36:45,200 --> 00:36:49,199
I was, my Gonca. Osman Bey is in a great war.

345
00:36:49,560 --> 00:36:53,399
We will do what suits us, Germiyan.

346
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:58,599
We will stand behind Osman
Bey. We cannot be enemies now.

347
00:36:58,720 --> 00:37:02,439
What changed in two days?
-I owe Osman Bey.

348
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:05,199
I don't like owing to someone.

349
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:15,839
My Shahzade.

350
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:34,039
Mehmet approached me in a
friendly manner and reached his hand.

351
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:38,679
But he is not a man who can do this.

352
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:43,999
-Did something different happen?
-Nothing happened, my Shahzade.

353
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:48,719
Keep your eyes on him. Learn if there is...

354
00:37:49,040 --> 00:37:52,039
...something different behind this.
-Don't worry.

355
00:37:58,320 --> 00:38:00,799
Put it on your arm.

356
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:04,239
It will heal you.

357
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:06,599
Ghazi Alp sent it.

358
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:10,559
He wants his father to
recover as soon as possible.

359
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:14,439
So my valiant is worried about his father huh?

360
00:38:15,240 --> 00:38:18,159
-Thank you my Shahzade.
-Thnak you.

361
00:38:18,360 --> 00:38:20,759
Safely.

362
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:35,959
All the warriors from the west
are coming here in crowds.

363
00:38:36,120 --> 00:38:39,639
Prisoners waiting to be killed,outlaws...

364
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:43,759
...templars, knights.

365
00:38:44,560 --> 00:38:47,959
Don't forget the Catalans,
Imren Tegin. They will...

366
00:38:48,080 --> 00:38:53,399
...all be under your command as a massive army.
-Never.

367
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:56,999
How many times did they stand
against Osman with their armies?

368
00:38:57,120 --> 00:39:00,279
Mongols, Byzantines, how many times?

369
00:39:00,480 --> 00:39:04,279
Which one defeated them in that field?

370
00:39:05,520 --> 00:39:13,479
There won't be an army. Turks unite
very quickly when they face common enemy.

371
00:39:18,160 --> 00:39:24,479
We will eat Osman's flesh by blowing like a mouse.

372
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:29,319
We will poison the waters,
we will burn the fields.

373
00:39:29,680 --> 00:39:34,439
We will attack the caravans,
we will make animals sick.

374
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:40,239
We will make sure people
cannot trust each other. Then...

375
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:46,319
...Osman's head will fall!

376
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:18,359
Welcome, Kanyumaz.

377
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:21,599
I knew you would find right path in the end.

378
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:31,359
So, what news did you bring?

379
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:45,039
I know, you are having a rough time.

380
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:49,319
You think you are betraying a Bey of Turks.

381
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:53,679
However, I am a Turk as well.

382
00:40:53,840 --> 00:40:57,679
Beys also draw their swords against each other.

383
00:40:58,440 --> 00:41:04,239
Do not worry, I will not forget
about you when I have these lands.

384
00:41:04,720 --> 00:41:10,399
I will not forget about your family as
well. So you best not forget about it too.

385
00:41:14,040 --> 00:41:16,719
Hatun, do not worry.

386
00:41:17,120 --> 00:41:21,479
I will save you from here.
Hold on a little longer.

387
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:33,039
Do you still object, Kanyumaz?

388
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:39,359
-I will make you pay for...
-Ssshhh.

389
00:41:39,600 --> 00:41:44,199
Your hatun and your child
are the only ones to pay a price.

390
00:41:44,600 --> 00:41:49,479
You will tell me everything
between Mehmed and Osman.

391
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:56,159
If you do not, you don't
want to know what I will do.

392
00:41:59,720 --> 00:42:05,159
Now tell me, what news did you bring?

393
00:42:05,600 --> 00:42:08,119
Mehmed Bey..

394
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:13,919
..thinks that Atranos is
not Osman's primary target.

395
00:42:19,960 --> 00:42:24,879
So Osman makes another move other than Atranos.

396
00:42:27,120 --> 00:42:31,639
Imren Tegin, now give me back my family.

397
00:42:33,240 --> 00:42:37,039
Do not worry. I will take care of your family.

398
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:43,199
I will be done with you when Osman dies.

399
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:49,399
-Take him.
-Imren Tegin..

400
00:42:56,560 --> 00:42:59,719
I killed Bayindir to bring
Osman at the doors of Atranos.

401
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:02,999
We would've brought soldiers
when he came through Kite..

402
00:43:03,120 --> 00:43:05,559
..and escape through castle's secret passages.

403
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:07,319
What changed?

404
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:13,759
It seems Osman figured out my plan.

405
00:43:14,240 --> 00:43:17,359
He won't be threatened from all sides.

406
00:43:18,560 --> 00:43:21,919
He will walk to Kite first.

407
00:43:23,080 --> 00:43:26,559
There must be a secret encampment nearby.

408
00:43:27,200 --> 00:43:32,039
Search for it. We will paint
that encampment with blood.

409
00:43:33,200 --> 00:43:38,719
Holofira, we are going away
from here. Andrea, pack up.

410
00:43:39,200 --> 00:43:41,199
What is it, aunt? Why?

411
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:44,399
Imren Tegin will kill us.

412
00:43:44,640 --> 00:43:50,119
It is our turn after the lords,
I've heard it with my own ears.

413
00:43:50,520 --> 00:43:55,119
Aunt, the castle is under
siege. How will we get out?

414
00:43:55,360 --> 00:43:58,079
Even if we do, where will we go?

415
00:43:58,360 --> 00:44:02,999
-To Osman Bey.
-What do you mean to Osman Bey?

416
00:44:03,360 --> 00:44:06,799
I will befriend the enemy of my enemy.

417
00:44:07,320 --> 00:44:09,879
Only he can help us.

418
00:44:10,080 --> 00:44:13,639
No one can kill Imren Tegin but Osman.

419
00:44:20,320 --> 00:44:24,599
Everything's all set, my lady.
I will get you out, however..

420
00:44:25,240 --> 00:44:26,559
However what?

421
00:44:26,720 --> 00:44:32,279
Our only^way out is the hole
where we throw out garbage.

422
00:44:35,480 --> 00:44:38,079
We have to do this.

423
00:44:38,440 --> 00:44:43,159
We don't have any other option to get
rid of Imren Tegin, come on we leave.

424
00:44:43,160 --> 00:44:44,199
We don't have any other option to get
rid of Imren Tegin, come on we leave.

425
00:44:44,720 --> 00:44:47,159
Come on.

426
00:45:29,040 --> 00:45:33,119
We saw them digging a
tunnel towards the Castle Kite.

427
00:46:41,240 --> 00:46:45,239
I will disrupt all of your plans, Osman.

428
00:47:51,880 --> 00:47:55,079
My valiant.

429
00:47:57,800 --> 00:48:02,959
My valiant..

430
00:48:10,080 --> 00:48:14,039
No.

431
00:48:16,720 --> 00:48:19,159
My valiants..

432
00:48:20,360 --> 00:48:23,639
My alps..

433
00:48:32,080 --> 00:48:36,679
Cerkutay, Boran.

434
00:48:48,080 --> 00:48:54,039
Orhan.. Konur!

435
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:04,759
My sons..

436
00:49:05,520 --> 00:49:10,439
Orhan.. Alaeddin..

437
00:49:28,000 --> 00:49:32,759
Orhan! Alaeddin!

438
00:51:33,640 --> 00:51:37,639
The State of Osman..

439
00:52:23,120 --> 00:52:26,199
My Osman?

440
00:52:27,640 --> 00:52:30,439
My Osman?

441
00:52:32,240 --> 00:52:37,239
Osman? My Bey?

442
00:52:38,880 --> 00:52:42,199
My Bey, what happened?

443
00:52:58,320 --> 00:53:03,479
-Are you alright?
-Bala..

444
00:53:04,600 --> 00:53:09,639
I am alright.

445
00:53:12,160 --> 00:53:16,519
I saw a dream..

446
00:53:17,920 --> 00:53:21,239
..my sons..

447
00:53:21,560 --> 00:53:25,359
..my alps..

448
00:53:27,400 --> 00:53:30,119
..this is hard.

449
00:53:31,880 --> 00:53:38,039
It was very hard.

450
00:53:38,680 --> 00:53:42,719
The challenge of such a blessed
road will be hard, my Osman.

451
00:53:43,120 --> 00:53:46,479
You decided walk knowing that, right?

452
00:53:54,640 --> 00:53:57,879
It will be tough.

453
00:54:01,040 --> 00:54:03,599
But I can see the end.

454
00:54:05,480 --> 00:54:09,839
The end will be good for us.

455
00:54:10,360 --> 00:54:14,639
The end will be good. Look.

456
00:54:15,160 --> 00:54:19,399
My children are in our house.

457
00:54:19,840 --> 00:54:23,599
With our fellows,

458
00:54:24,160 --> 00:54:30,439
...we will achieve our goal. We will. We will.

459
00:54:32,080 --> 00:54:35,079
Our dream will come true.

460
00:54:35,400 --> 00:54:38,679
If Allah permits, my Osman.
If Allah permits.

461
00:54:40,080 --> 00:54:44,519
We will walk in this path as long as we can.

462
00:54:44,640 --> 00:54:49,999
Yes, we will. We will walk.

463
00:54:51,080 --> 00:54:57,159
-Were you going to say something?
-Orhan and the others are waiting for you.

464
00:55:00,560 --> 00:55:05,319
Let's go then. Come on.

465
00:55:25,440 --> 00:55:30,399
Fatma, are you cooking
halvah? I could have made it.

466
00:55:30,440 --> 00:55:35,719
I'm making it for my brothers, Ulgen Hatun.
You know, both of them are broken-hearted.

467
00:55:36,160 --> 00:55:39,319
-This mat sweeten their mouths.
-Well thought.

468
00:55:39,600 --> 00:55:45,079
Maybe, Shahzade Alaaddin and
Gonca Hatun will come together, huh?

469
00:55:45,160 --> 00:55:48,519
No! That tall Shahzade will never...

470
00:55:48,680 --> 00:55:51,399
Alright, you will marry Gonca. What was I saying?

471
00:55:51,560 --> 00:55:54,879
They may come together. Don't
be upset. There he bites again!

472
00:55:55,000 --> 00:55:58,479
Even if you silence me,
you can't silence my heart!

473
00:55:58,640 --> 00:56:02,959
You hid Gonca Hatun as you were jealous,
right? I won't talk to you anymore!

474
00:56:03,240 --> 00:56:07,639
-Alright, Ghazi. Ghazi!
-My Allah...

475
00:56:08,920 --> 00:56:13,479
-I throw or you run?
-No! No!

476
00:56:15,480 --> 00:56:22,039
Sister Ulgen, do you know
something about Gonca Hatun?

477
00:56:22,880 --> 00:56:27,839
You really think she and my brother
will make peace after all what happened?

478
00:56:29,720 --> 00:56:31,799
I don't know.

479
00:56:32,800 --> 00:56:37,199
But I can see they still love each other.

480
00:56:38,240 --> 00:56:43,479
It's love, Fatma. You can't
put out that fire so easily.

481
00:56:43,720 --> 00:56:47,079
I agree, but my brother Orhan...

482
00:56:47,440 --> 00:56:53,079
I don't know what he'll do.
Even if Orhan says yes...

483
00:56:53,880 --> 00:56:57,839
I don't want to think about what will happen...

484
00:56:57,880 --> 00:57:00,879
...when Holofira hears
about Orhan and Elcim Hatun.

485
00:57:01,920 --> 00:57:05,679
She will be ruined. Pity.

486
00:57:06,000 --> 00:57:08,999
I feel sorry for them.

487
00:57:21,160 --> 00:57:23,999
Holofira.

488
00:57:33,160 --> 00:57:38,039
Catalans, Varangians... Emperor
released even the prisoners.

489
00:57:38,160 --> 00:57:44,319
He's sending them to our lands in good numbers.
They're coming in waves to fight us, my Bey.

490
00:57:44,520 --> 00:57:49,799
He promised some of them booties
and sent some to fight for Cross.

491
00:57:51,520 --> 00:57:56,679
But after all, they are coming to take Isabel.

492
00:57:57,280 --> 00:58:01,799
-Where are they going?
-To the castle of Kite, my Bey.

493
00:58:01,960 --> 00:58:05,679
Kite is the most available place
for raiding and looting, my Bey.

494
00:58:05,880 --> 00:58:09,159
If they deploy there, they
will start raiding around.

495
00:58:09,400 --> 00:58:12,639
And the Mongolian trouble will go on.

496
00:58:14,520 --> 00:58:19,639
If we don't break Imren Tegin,
we'll stay between two fires.

497
00:58:20,080 --> 00:58:23,039
The latest information shows us...

498
00:58:23,360 --> 00:58:27,239
...how important the conquest of Kite is.

499
00:58:29,440 --> 00:58:33,119
If the looters Shahzade Orhan mentioned come,

500
00:58:33,480 --> 00:58:35,679
...things will be harder for us, Osman Bey.

501
00:58:35,840 --> 00:58:41,399
We won't let them, Gunduz Bey. We
will have captured Kite before they arrive.

502
00:58:43,320 --> 00:58:47,239
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in!

503
00:58:48,280 --> 00:58:51,159
My Bey, they attacked the headquarter of Kite.

504
00:58:51,520 --> 00:58:54,039
What?

505
00:58:54,960 --> 00:59:01,079
Imren Tegin raided suddenly and
they burned everything down, my Bey.

506
00:59:06,720 --> 00:59:09,719
Imren Tegin, huh?

507
00:59:10,680 --> 00:59:15,599
Imren Tegin... Is that so?

508
00:59:17,360 --> 00:59:22,799
We will see. We will see.

509
00:59:33,040 --> 00:59:35,839
Gunduz Bey.

510
00:59:39,600 --> 00:59:42,199
What is happening?

511
00:59:44,680 --> 00:59:51,919
Tell me. We won't fall into despair just
because they attacked the headquarter, will we?

512
00:59:55,400 --> 00:59:59,639
Bala Hatun. Malhun Hatun.

513
01:00:00,600 --> 01:00:04,759
We won't vanish even if they break us! My sons.

514
01:00:05,400 --> 01:00:11,799
Orhan! Alaaddin!
Shh... Don't! Don't!

515
01:00:13,440 --> 01:00:14,159
We...

516
01:00:15,880 --> 01:00:22,279
...are the Ummah of Rasulullah (PBUH)
who got over every hardship he experienced.

517
01:00:23,840 --> 01:00:28,679
If they hit our headquarters, of course
we will make them pay for it heavily.

518
01:00:28,840 --> 01:00:34,839
If they killed our Bey dastardly,
we will behead a hundred lords!

519
01:00:36,600 --> 01:00:40,039
If they attack us with an army...

520
01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:44,439
...we will crush them with our horses.

521
01:00:48,200 --> 01:00:52,519
We will take Kite tomorrow. Get ready.

522
01:00:57,200 --> 01:01:02,199
-At this time, Osman Bey?
-At this time!

523
01:01:03,920 --> 01:01:10,479
Now they will not think that we
will attack. That's why we will attack.

524
01:01:11,360 --> 01:01:17,439
Bala Hatun... They are not aware of the
sisters we have been preparing secretly.

525
01:01:17,920 --> 01:01:21,199
Now it's time. You have the key of the castle.

526
01:01:21,240 --> 01:01:23,719
The Turkish woman standing behind her man...

527
01:01:23,840 --> 01:01:28,159
...is ready to drink the sherbet of shahada
before her man, my Bey. Don't worry.

528
01:01:28,400 --> 01:01:32,119
Thank you. They will all see tomorrow.

529
01:01:35,360 --> 01:01:38,439
-Boran!
-My Bey!

530
01:01:40,480 --> 01:01:44,359
Send news to that Imren Tegin.

531
01:01:46,200 --> 01:01:51,479
I will talk to him one on one near Atranos.

532
01:01:53,080 --> 01:01:56,999
Yes my Bey.

533
01:02:01,520 --> 01:02:04,079
We will see.

534
01:02:19,000 --> 01:02:24,119
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

535
01:02:49,720 --> 01:02:53,199
All the executioners of the west are here!

536
01:02:53,480 --> 01:02:57,679
Your swords will be covered in
blood, your bags will be filled with gold!

537
01:02:57,760 --> 01:03:01,119
We will make history in these lands!

538
01:03:03,960 --> 01:03:09,799
Those who can gather them around
a table can make history as well!

539
01:03:10,520 --> 01:03:15,559
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

540
01:03:19,720 --> 01:03:23,279
Soon, the siege of Atranos will be removed.

541
01:03:23,560 --> 01:03:27,159
Osman's failure to consider
the passages cost him dearly.

542
01:03:29,360 --> 01:03:35,119
Now... I have gifts for you. Bring them!

543
01:04:04,560 --> 01:04:09,239
I brought these women through
the secret passage for you!

544
01:04:09,360 --> 01:04:13,319
I will raise their children
and make them my warriors!

545
01:04:29,720 --> 01:04:30,839
Take them!

546
01:04:39,760 --> 01:04:46,399
I am the grandson of Keykavus
from the Seljuk lineage.

547
01:04:47,320 --> 01:04:52,519
An arrow I shoot towards the
west will return to me as an army.

548
01:04:54,760 --> 01:04:59,519
Both Turkish and Byzantine blood flow in my veins.

549
01:04:59,840 --> 01:05:02,959
I am Imren Tegin.

550
01:05:03,080 --> 01:05:05,319
I will be the only ruler of Roman Empire!

551
01:05:05,440 --> 01:05:10,919
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

552
01:05:12,800 --> 01:05:18,119
We will take this right together, my siblings.

553
01:05:18,880 --> 01:05:22,519
I will establish a kingdom.
I will take Osman's lands...

554
01:05:22,520 --> 01:05:25,760
...and establish a kingdom
which will unite both sides.

555
01:05:25,760 --> 01:05:29,630
A kingdom where only
the powerful's desires are fulfilled...

556
01:05:29,630 --> 01:05:33,639
...where only the sword and courage are respected.

557
01:05:35,920 --> 01:05:43,159
Here, great prices will be paid, and
they will be paid back with interest!

558
01:05:44,800 --> 01:05:48,279
When the kingdom under my rule is established...

559
01:05:48,400 --> 01:05:52,999
...the Catalans will govern their own seats.

560
01:05:54,160 --> 01:05:56,599
The Varangians will be able to...

561
01:05:56,720 --> 01:06:01,719
...take their ships and set sail whenever
they want, just like in the old days!

562
01:06:01,920 --> 01:06:07,159
The Templars will be able to find as
many weapons and horses as they desire!

563
01:06:08,600 --> 01:06:12,759
You will serve me!

564
01:06:12,880 --> 01:06:15,239
I will make your dreams come true!

565
01:06:15,360 --> 01:06:20,719
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

566
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:42,239
Imren Tegin... Osman sent
news. He wants to talk to you.

567
01:06:43,200 --> 01:06:48,239
He couldn't defeat us, he must
have decided to kiss our hand.

568
01:06:48,880 --> 01:06:52,759
Osman wants to see me to kneel before me!

569
01:06:57,720 --> 01:07:02,239
Tell him... I will see him.

570
01:07:02,440 --> 01:07:07,639
One day, we will also celebrate the victory
of taking Osman's head at this table.

571
01:07:07,760 --> 01:07:11,599
Enjoy!

572
01:07:22,880 --> 01:07:26,119
Come! Come!

573
01:08:13,080 --> 01:08:18,479
Allah Almighty speaks the truth. My Allah...

574
01:08:19,200 --> 01:08:23,319
I seek refuge in You alone and
ask for Your mercy. Grant me...

575
01:08:23,720 --> 01:08:28,599
...and my children the victory
of defeating the infidels...

576
01:08:28,800 --> 01:08:34,118
...and raising the sanjak of
Islam throughout the world.

577
01:08:34,560 --> 01:08:38,719
O my Allah, may You reward
our martyrs whose blood...

578
01:08:38,960 --> 01:08:41,519
...watered our land with Your jannah.

579
01:08:41,880 --> 01:08:46,319
Make them neighbors to our
Prophet Efendi (PBUH), my Allah.

580
01:08:46,439 --> 01:08:52,879
Allow us to take the revenge of
our martyrs, my Allah. Aameen.

581
01:09:02,680 --> 01:09:08,198
-Can I come in, my Bey?
-Come in.

582
01:09:13,200 --> 01:09:16,919
My Bey, as you ordered, we
found the houses of our martyrs.

583
01:09:17,160 --> 01:09:20,399
Okay. Fulfill their needs.

584
01:09:20,640 --> 01:09:25,238
They are the entrustments of our
valiants. We will always embrace them.

585
01:09:25,359 --> 01:09:28,118
Yes my Bey.

586
01:09:36,840 --> 01:09:41,238
My Orhan... I don't want to stress you.

587
01:09:41,479 --> 01:09:44,639
I know how hard it is for you, but..

588
01:09:44,760 --> 01:09:47,759
...everyone expects you to make a decision.

589
01:09:47,880 --> 01:09:50,799
Elcim said she will obey her father.

590
01:09:51,080 --> 01:09:55,079
What will be your decision?

591
01:09:55,960 --> 01:10:00,719
Mother... You know what my heart says.

592
01:10:01,880 --> 01:10:04,879
I love Holofira.

593
01:10:05,240 --> 01:10:09,519
-I know, my son... I know, but...
-But, for the well-being of the state...

594
01:10:09,720 --> 01:10:13,639
...you want me to marry Elcim Hatun, right?

595
01:10:16,600 --> 01:10:20,279
Mother, you never wanted Holofira.

596
01:10:21,640 --> 01:10:25,679
Believe me, my heart is
also in pain, just like yours.

597
01:10:25,800 --> 01:10:27,439
You are my child.

598
01:10:27,480 --> 01:10:31,039
But that's what I've been trying
to tell you from the beginning...

599
01:10:31,120 --> 01:10:34,759
-It's about the state!
-I know, mother.

600
01:10:34,880 --> 01:10:37,199
I know, it's about the state.

601
01:10:37,360 --> 01:10:43,679
Let's assume that I said yes, gave up on
myself and accepted to marry Elcim Hatun.

602
01:10:43,920 --> 01:10:45,239
What about Holofira?

603
01:10:47,040 --> 01:10:48,599
What will happen to her, mother?

604
01:10:51,160 --> 01:10:54,039
While I love Holofira for all these years..

605
01:10:54,160 --> 01:10:58,079
..how will I tell her this?

606
01:10:58,560 --> 01:11:03,279
How will I say, "I will marry another hatun"?

607
01:11:05,080 --> 01:11:08,919
Allah gives the challenge to
those who can handle it, they say.

608
01:11:09,200 --> 01:11:13,159
You are strong enough to
overcome this challenge, Orhan.

609
01:11:13,400 --> 01:11:17,799
You will do the right thing, for our future.

610
01:11:20,680 --> 01:11:24,439
Are we allowed, Malhun Hatun?

611
01:11:24,680 --> 01:11:27,239
Come in.

612
01:11:31,280 --> 01:11:35,879
Ulgen Hatun sends word.
Holofira and her aunt has come.

613
01:11:36,040 --> 01:11:39,439
-They are coming here.
-What?

614
01:11:52,240 --> 01:11:55,919
-Who are these hatuns?
-This is..

615
01:11:56,440 --> 01:12:01,079
..this is her. The lover of Shahzade Orhan.

616
01:12:03,040 --> 01:12:05,719
The daughter of lord.

617
01:12:28,280 --> 01:12:32,479
What are you doing here
while Atranos is under siege?

618
01:12:32,640 --> 01:12:35,679
Olivia Hatun, are you here to beg?

619
01:12:35,800 --> 01:12:39,719
Never. I never beg to anyone, Malhun Hatun.

620
01:12:39,840 --> 01:12:46,159
I wouldn't be here if I didn't have to.
Your soldiers at Atranos are in danger.

621
01:12:46,360 --> 01:12:52,239
-What do you mean?
-Imren Tegin has a great plan.

622
01:12:54,680 --> 01:12:58,639
When he killed Bayindir Bey,
he knew you would siege Atranos.

623
01:12:58,960 --> 01:13:02,239
Now, he will attack your alps.

624
01:13:02,520 --> 01:13:05,879
Why would you do such a favor to us?

625
01:13:06,080 --> 01:13:09,999
Because Holofira and I are in danger.

626
01:13:12,840 --> 01:13:17,559
All the commanders at the castle
are under the rule of Imren Tegin.

627
01:13:17,680 --> 01:13:24,519
I had no choice but to take shelter
to you in order to protect Holofira.

628
01:13:30,200 --> 01:13:35,079
Olivia Hatun. Do not worry, you are safe here.

629
01:13:35,480 --> 01:13:40,839
However, what I don't understand is,
why does Imren Tegin wants to kill you?

630
01:13:43,560 --> 01:13:48,879
As we know, Imren Tegin is here
because of a letter sent to The Emperor.

631
01:13:49,040 --> 01:13:53,559
Imren Tegin says that The
Emperor supports him, however..

632
01:13:54,200 --> 01:13:58,359
..I don't think
Emperor trusts him.

633
01:13:59,400 --> 01:14:03,959
Imren killed all the lords.

634
01:14:04,520 --> 01:14:09,639
If we didn't escape, he
would've killed us as well.

635
01:14:15,200 --> 01:14:19,119
Alright then. Ulgen..

636
01:14:19,480 --> 01:14:25,759
..take Olivia Hatun and Holofira
to a safe house in Yenisehir.

637
01:14:26,040 --> 01:14:29,599
I am telling you Imren Tegin
is after us, Malhun Hatun!

638
01:14:38,760 --> 01:14:44,159
Mother. They are not safe in anywhere but palace.

639
01:14:50,600 --> 01:14:55,799
Ulgen, put alps on their door.

640
01:14:57,080 --> 01:15:00,319
My Valide.

641
01:15:07,080 --> 01:15:08,719
I can not leave Holofira.

642
01:15:08,880 --> 01:15:13,679
-We can not put the enemy among us, Orhan.
-They will not leave the room, mother.

643
01:15:14,600 --> 01:15:17,319
Our eyes will be on them.

644
01:15:22,920 --> 01:15:28,839
Ulgen, take them to the visitors room.

645
01:15:58,400 --> 01:16:01,839
Care! Osman Bey!

646
01:16:25,040 --> 01:16:29,789
O, the soldiers of Kayi! O, the valiants of Kayi!

647
01:16:33,080 --> 01:16:38,599
Some of your ancestors..

648
01:16:39,000 --> 01:16:43,799
..became martyrs to turn these lands into home!

649
01:16:47,120 --> 01:16:53,399
However, with Allah's permission,
we kept it as home, thank Allah

650
01:16:57,840 --> 01:17:02,469
We grew it, with the power
Allah gave us, thank Allah!

651
01:17:03,680 --> 01:17:08,239
And we always knew the words of
our fathers as the utmost important.

652
01:17:08,760 --> 01:17:16,879
Do not forget this! Those who are
afraid of growing are bound to stay small!

653
01:17:19,360 --> 01:17:25,639
That is why, we will never stop! We will march on!

654
01:17:26,000 --> 01:17:28,639
We will be worthy of our spilled blood!

655
01:17:28,800 --> 01:17:33,919
We will always endure the
swords that came in our way!

656
01:17:35,720 --> 01:17:40,759
And with Allah's permission,
we will be victorious, I hope.

657
01:17:44,920 --> 01:17:50,519
Now, our destination is Kite.

658
01:17:52,400 --> 01:17:56,959
Of course they burnt down our preparations!

659
01:17:57,720 --> 01:18:01,959
We will be wounded today,
however, do not forget this..

660
01:18:02,160 --> 01:18:09,959
..do not forget that they will
never have what we have!

661
01:18:14,560 --> 01:18:19,279
They will never have..

662
01:18:19,400 --> 01:18:22,679
..our faith and our hearts!

663
01:18:27,160 --> 01:18:30,719
O the valiants of Kayi!

664
01:18:30,840 --> 01:18:37,199
Our courage will destroy their walls today!

665
01:18:37,320 --> 01:18:40,759
If Allah permits!

666
01:18:43,200 --> 01:18:48,639
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

667
01:18:55,320 --> 01:19:00,199
-Our holy fight shall be blessed!
-Yes, my Bey!

668
01:19:32,480 --> 01:19:34,599
You've dragged Osman into a hole..

669
01:19:34,800 --> 01:19:38,519
..by destroying the Kite encampment, Imren Tegin.

670
01:19:39,920 --> 01:19:45,239
If he is clever, he would beg for forgiveness.

671
01:19:47,280 --> 01:19:53,359
I've heard from an old wise man. The real
battle starts with the defeat of one side.

672
01:19:53,520 --> 01:19:58,479
Osman must be ill-tempered now.
He must be waiting for a hope to strike.

673
01:19:58,840 --> 01:20:02,799
He will find his hope among
his burning encampment.

674
01:20:03,680 --> 01:20:09,559
You see the hope, when you
look at the eyes of your prey.

675
01:20:10,320 --> 01:20:15,799
Stay cautious. He will try me.

676
01:20:21,520 --> 01:20:27,119
Let us go and see what
Osman's tongue will spit out.

677
01:20:28,560 --> 01:20:32,029
Near Atranos Castle

678
01:21:33,720 --> 01:21:36,519
How did you know I would capture Kite?

679
01:21:36,680 --> 01:21:41,199
I was sure you would besiege Atranos
for the vengeance of Bayindir Bey first?

680
01:21:41,720 --> 01:21:44,479
I wanted this.

681
01:21:45,360 --> 01:21:47,879
And you did it.

682
01:21:49,880 --> 01:21:57,119
They praised you a lot. I thought the man
praised so much wouldn't act with anger.

683
01:21:58,320 --> 01:22:01,199
You underestimated me.

684
01:22:03,280 --> 01:22:06,799
I predicted your move.

685
01:22:13,160 --> 01:22:16,679
You ran into rough weather this time.

686
01:22:18,000 --> 01:22:21,239
Atranos' siege is just a distraction.

687
01:22:21,400 --> 01:22:24,799
I knew your real target was Kite.

688
01:22:25,520 --> 01:22:30,639
I played well and destroyed your headquarter.

689
01:22:31,360 --> 01:22:34,319
You turned out not be worthy
of the praises, Osman Bey.

690
01:22:34,400 --> 01:22:38,599
Atranos is still under siege. Tell me.

691
01:22:39,120 --> 01:22:42,079
Who will save you from me now?

692
01:22:42,400 --> 01:22:45,039
After your defeat in Kite,

693
01:22:45,280 --> 01:22:50,039
...can you really take
this risk? I don't think so.

694
01:22:50,600 --> 01:22:55,119
In Atranos, you will experience
what you experienced in Kite.

695
01:22:55,400 --> 01:22:59,959
All of these castles will be mine forever.

696
01:23:04,040 --> 01:23:10,039
Atranos is here. I'm here.
Come and get it, Osman Bey.

697
01:23:22,480 --> 01:23:25,479
We never turn down..

698
01:23:27,040 --> 01:23:30,479
...either our allies or enemies.

699
01:23:32,920 --> 01:23:37,799
I will take both your castle...

700
01:23:38,160 --> 01:23:41,519
...and your head personally.

701
01:23:46,920 --> 01:23:51,079
Just wait for me.

702
01:24:17,200 --> 01:24:20,959
-Come on!
-Move!

703
01:24:21,280 --> 01:24:23,759
-Faster!
-Come on!

704
01:24:25,840 --> 01:24:28,359
Come on.

705
01:24:29,480 --> 01:24:33,039
Move!

706
01:24:34,240 --> 01:24:36,839
There you come.

707
01:24:37,520 --> 01:24:41,239
We will make you regret
that you came to our lands.

708
01:24:48,640 --> 01:24:53,479
-Ya Haqq!
-Come on!

709
01:24:57,960 --> 01:25:00,399
Come on!

710
01:25:54,680 --> 01:25:59,839
Don't worry. Nobody will hurt you.
Our alps will take you to your homeland.

711
01:26:04,760 --> 01:26:07,639
Where is your homeland?

712
01:26:15,240 --> 01:26:19,599
You can either hear nor speak, huh?

713
01:26:30,920 --> 01:26:35,799
Elcim Hatun, you are good at swords. Praise be!

714
01:26:36,520 --> 01:26:39,119
Not better than you, Bala Hatun.

715
01:26:39,240 --> 01:26:43,679
You know, Kayi women are as good as Kayi men.

716
01:26:43,760 --> 01:26:46,959
Both at fighting and politics.

717
01:26:47,520 --> 01:26:50,519
Who taught you to use the
sword so well, Elcim Hatun?

718
01:26:50,600 --> 01:26:53,039
Mongolian threat, of course.

719
01:26:53,720 --> 01:26:56,879
We didn't grow up in the palace, Orhan Bey.

720
01:26:58,280 --> 01:27:02,639
In the east, you will pay for it with
your life if you don't use the sword well.

721
01:27:06,200 --> 01:27:12,319
Bala Hatun, this woman is deaf
mute. She neither hears nor speaks.

722
01:27:14,520 --> 01:27:18,479
This hatun can't find the
way. We shouldn't leave her be.

723
01:27:19,160 --> 01:27:22,479
Of course we won't, Elcim Hatun.

724
01:27:23,480 --> 01:27:28,159
-We'll make her settle in Yenisehir.
-Well said, Bala Hatun.

725
01:27:28,280 --> 01:27:31,919
Otherwise, heathens will kill her.

726
01:27:32,840 --> 01:27:39,319
Sisters, hatuns... You are alright, aren't you?

727
01:27:39,760 --> 01:27:42,999
You are free now. Go to your lands.

728
01:27:43,320 --> 01:27:48,799
Our alps and sisters will help you. Come on.

729
01:27:55,800 --> 01:28:00,079
-Everything is set.
-Everybody should be very careful.

730
01:28:00,160 --> 01:28:03,559
-We're going into the scorpion's nest.
-It won't be easy.

731
01:28:03,680 --> 01:28:06,639
But we're ready to sacrifice our lives.

732
01:28:06,960 --> 01:28:11,719
Tough fights will bring
great victories, Elcim Hatun.

733
01:28:13,560 --> 01:28:17,199
Come on. We need to go.

734
01:29:11,640 --> 01:29:17,119
They burned everything down. All
our preparations have gone for nothing.

735
01:29:19,320 --> 01:29:22,519
But you will see.

736
01:29:22,840 --> 01:29:26,799
Allah will give us a great victory.

737
01:29:27,200 --> 01:29:30,359
You will see.

738
01:29:32,000 --> 01:29:37,479
Bury our martyrs. Heal all the wounded ones.

739
01:29:39,040 --> 01:29:41,519
How did the dog called Imren
Tegin find the headquarter, my Bey?

740
01:29:41,600 --> 01:29:43,679
We have a traitor inside, obviously.

741
01:29:43,840 --> 01:29:48,439
Obviously, someone tells him. Or
he couldn't have found this place.

742
01:29:48,680 --> 01:29:52,959
But now that dog will think
we're going to march to Atranos.

743
01:29:53,000 --> 01:29:56,079
Let him think so!

744
01:30:01,680 --> 01:30:03,879
Gunduz Bey!

745
01:30:06,680 --> 01:30:09,959
My alps are ready to fight, Osman Bey.

746
01:30:10,080 --> 01:30:14,799
Thank you, live long.
On such a day they burned our everything down,

747
01:30:14,840 --> 01:30:16,599
...your alps came just in time.

748
01:30:16,720 --> 01:30:19,839
It's an honor to be fight with you, Osman Bey.

749
01:30:20,000 --> 01:30:22,119
However tired my alps are,

750
01:30:22,240 --> 01:30:25,399
...for the settlement of Turks
and the unity of Kayi people,

751
01:30:25,560 --> 01:30:28,519
they will fight like a valiant if Allah permits.

752
01:30:30,120 --> 01:30:35,679
Thank you. We can see our
friends only in difficult times.

753
01:30:35,880 --> 01:30:38,839
You showed us that you are our friend.

754
01:30:39,080 --> 01:30:44,159
Now... It is time for us to show our enmity.

755
01:30:44,360 --> 01:30:48,999
You will see! With Allah's consent,
we will gain a glorious victory.

756
01:30:49,280 --> 01:30:53,279
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits.

757
01:30:57,400 --> 01:31:02,919
I don't trust Olivia, Ulgen. Keep your
eyes on them. They won't talk to anyone.

758
01:31:03,160 --> 01:31:09,959
You will watch them. If they
make a move, we will catch them.

759
01:31:10,240 --> 01:31:15,599
I won't even blink, Malhun Hatun. I know my duty.

760
01:31:18,880 --> 01:31:23,759
Is Imren Tegin bringing his
own men to break the siege?

761
01:31:23,880 --> 01:31:27,559
That's what Olivia Hatun says. It
aligns with what my Orhan said but..

762
01:31:27,720 --> 01:31:31,239
...I don't know if they are playing
a game or telling the truth, my Bey.

763
01:31:31,400 --> 01:31:36,439
We will understand, we
will. But I am seeing that...

764
01:31:36,600 --> 01:31:40,799
...Holofira is confusing you.

765
01:31:42,080 --> 01:31:44,919
Their arrival, seeking refuge from us...

766
01:31:45,160 --> 01:31:49,439
...seems as if they're here to use Orhan's love.

767
01:31:49,880 --> 01:31:51,759
I am not comfortable with this at all, Osman.

768
01:31:51,829 --> 01:31:55,939
If it weren't for Orhan,
I would never allow such a thing.

769
01:31:58,240 --> 01:32:02,599
Learn how they got out of the
castle. Keep your eyes on them.

770
01:32:02,760 --> 01:32:07,719
We will know every step they
take. They won't talk to anyone.

771
01:32:07,960 --> 01:32:12,679
If there is a game, we will also find that out.

772
01:32:15,600 --> 01:32:20,079
Holofira... Can we come in, my daughter?

773
01:32:22,480 --> 01:32:26,439
Come in, Malhun Hatun.

774
01:32:29,600 --> 01:32:33,559
So it was in our destiny to see
you wearing our clothes, huh?

775
01:32:35,000 --> 01:32:38,279
Anything can happen in our lives, Malhun Hatun.

776
01:32:38,680 --> 01:32:41,879
Everything can be destroyed in one night.

777
01:32:42,240 --> 01:32:45,879
Right. Right, but...

778
01:32:46,160 --> 01:32:50,479
...not everyone can get out of...

779
01:32:51,040 --> 01:32:54,759
...a besieged castle, Olivia Hatun.

780
01:32:56,800 --> 01:33:00,479
That's why I am confused.

781
01:33:00,600 --> 01:33:05,039
So that Imren Tegin was going to kill you...

782
01:33:06,160 --> 01:33:11,079
...how could you escape from
the castle when you were alone?

783
01:33:12,200 --> 01:33:15,239
I ruled that castle for so many years.

784
01:33:17,880 --> 01:33:22,559
I have a loyal commander. He helped me.

785
01:33:25,240 --> 01:33:29,799
There's a gap where we piled up the
castle's garbage, and we escaped from there.

786
01:33:30,040 --> 01:33:34,159
Otherwise, only our dead bodies
would have come out from the castle gate.

787
01:33:37,960 --> 01:33:42,359
Wouldn't you become allies? Didn't you...

788
01:33:42,520 --> 01:33:47,239
...invite the executioner of
Byzantium to cause difficulties for us?

789
01:33:48,600 --> 01:33:53,159
Holofira? I guess that's what you said to Orhan.

790
01:33:56,040 --> 01:33:59,799
Yes. I told him.

791
01:34:00,320 --> 01:34:02,919
My aunt invited him.

792
01:34:06,720 --> 01:34:11,159
Why would that man want to kill you?

793
01:34:11,800 --> 01:34:15,319
He is at the frontiers thanks to you.

794
01:34:19,200 --> 01:34:24,839
Imren Tegin is a demon. I made a mistake.

795
01:34:25,720 --> 01:34:30,039
I invited our own executioner with my own hands.

796
01:34:32,360 --> 01:34:37,559
You were lucky. You were able to
wake up from your sleep of carelessness...

797
01:34:37,960 --> 01:34:41,639
...before your executioner strangled you.

798
01:34:45,840 --> 01:34:50,359
I want to forget what happened in the past
and make an agreement with Osman Bey.

799
01:34:50,760 --> 01:34:55,239
Osman Bey was always honest,
even when he was our enemy.

800
01:35:05,080 --> 01:35:08,159
you allow me.

801
01:35:15,200 --> 01:35:18,479
You came in such a time that...

802
01:35:18,920 --> 01:35:22,719
...I hope you won't let me down, Holofira.

803
01:35:26,720 --> 01:35:30,919
It's strange, right? You..

804
01:35:31,200 --> 01:35:36,799
...are going to surround my castle,
and I am taking shelter in your house.

805
01:35:37,160 --> 01:35:43,039
This is also your house, Holofira.
Everywhere I am is your home.

806
01:35:43,480 --> 01:35:48,799
I have nowhere else to go but you.

807
01:35:53,600 --> 01:35:57,759
Holofira...

808
01:36:07,440 --> 01:36:10,559
You are the only owner of
my heart, Lord's daughter.

809
01:36:10,840 --> 01:36:15,639
Whatever you see, whatever you hear...

810
01:36:16,320 --> 01:36:22,959
...don't you forget this. My heart belongs to you.

811
01:36:44,000 --> 01:36:48,599
We brought the prisoners! Open the doors!

812
01:36:48,600 --> 01:36:49,319
We brought the prisoners! Open the doors!

813
01:36:52,960 --> 01:36:56,639
It is too narrow. Let's take the
Hatuns behind us. Come on.

814
01:37:01,960 --> 01:37:04,460
You seem too calm,
Orhan Bey. Holofira is not

815
01:37:04,472 --> 01:37:07,039
in the castle, is that
why you are so relieved?

816
01:37:07,280 --> 01:37:12,279
You can never be a prisoner
Elcim Hatun. Your mind and tongue...

817
01:37:12,400 --> 01:37:15,079
...are as sharp as your sword.
-You should know that.

818
01:37:15,120 --> 01:37:17,256
I will never be a
prisoner, and I will never

819
01:37:17,268 --> 01:37:19,559
bow down. Think about
that marriage issue again.

820
01:37:19,600 --> 01:37:23,079
Alright! Go on!

821
01:37:28,080 --> 01:37:30,359
Go on!

822
01:37:47,920 --> 01:37:50,719
-You were late.
-They were angry.

823
01:37:50,840 --> 01:37:53,839
It was hard to control them, but we did it.

824
01:37:54,160 --> 01:37:56,279
Which way did you use?

825
01:37:56,400 --> 01:37:58,240
We don't know these lands very well.

826
01:37:58,240 --> 01:38:01,480
They said, "Head towards the west."
That's how we found the castle.

827
01:38:01,480 --> 01:38:05,599
We sent you a letter.
Everything was written there.

828
01:38:07,160 --> 01:38:11,559
Show me the letter.

829
01:38:16,320 --> 01:38:19,719
-Come on!
-Ya Allah!

830
01:38:22,880 --> 01:38:26,679
Come on Sisters!

831
01:39:29,000 --> 01:39:34,599
Allah is the Greatest!
Allah is the Greatest!

832
01:39:40,040 --> 01:39:41,399
Come on!

833
01:39:43,480 --> 01:39:47,079
Hold the doors! Close the doors!

834
01:39:47,360 --> 01:39:50,639
The doors!

835
01:39:52,720 --> 01:39:56,079
I am going there!

836
01:40:13,880 --> 01:40:17,479
Elcim Hatun!

837
01:40:39,520 --> 01:40:43,559
Come on Alps!
Attack, for Bayindir Bey!

838
01:40:55,400 --> 01:40:58,679
Hold the doors!
-This door is the door of gaza!

839
01:40:58,840 --> 01:41:02,359
This door won't be closed!

840
01:41:02,720 --> 01:41:08,279
The valiants are on the battlefield! They will
fall and we will win! Allah is the Greatest!

841
01:41:17,040 --> 01:41:22,639
Alps! Kite Castle is now ours! Attack!

842
01:41:34,200 --> 01:41:36,359
Bala, you are alright, right?
-I am, Osman Bey.

843
01:41:36,480 --> 01:41:40,919
I missed fighting next to you!
-I missed that as well!

844
01:41:45,280 --> 01:41:48,319
Look at them. What do you see, huh?

845
01:41:57,240 --> 01:42:01,439
I see us, Osman Bey. I see
our youth. But we were faster.

846
01:42:01,560 --> 01:42:04,719
Come on, Osman Bey.
-We are still fast!

847
01:42:22,240 --> 01:42:26,879
The commander of these coward
dogs is running away! Inform Osman Bey!

848
01:42:46,760 --> 01:42:49,639
My Bey, the Commander of
the Castle is running away!

849
01:42:49,800 --> 01:42:55,319
He cannot go anywhere! Orhan! Take the castle!

850
01:42:55,440 --> 01:43:00,959
Yes my Bey! Alps! Go everywhere!

851
01:43:46,160 --> 01:43:51,319
Allah is the Greatest!

852
01:44:02,160 --> 01:44:07,279
Where are you going, huh?
-I won't die alone here.

853
01:44:10,880 --> 01:44:13,919
I will send you alone.

854
01:44:14,560 --> 01:44:17,897
But don't worry. You
won't stay alone there for

855
01:44:17,909 --> 01:44:21,119
a long time. I will send
the others after you.

856
01:44:52,480 --> 01:44:55,959
Now, you will tell me about Imren Tegin's move.

857
01:44:56,120 --> 01:44:59,759
If you tell the truth, I will spare your life.

858
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:03,399
Alright, stop.

859
01:45:03,560 --> 01:45:08,359
As you say, there are infidels coming in crowds.

860
01:45:08,640 --> 01:45:14,079
They were going to gather at Kite,
but they will gather in front of Kite now.

861
01:45:14,280 --> 01:45:17,679
You have no escape, Osman. That army will..

862
01:45:18,000 --> 01:45:20,759
..destroy you and the siege of Atranos.

863
01:45:31,600 --> 01:45:35,479
We are the only one here who keep their words.

864
01:45:35,680 --> 01:45:40,839
However, you are the ones being dogs.

865
01:46:43,360 --> 01:46:49,519
Praise be! Thank you my Creator!

866
01:46:49,640 --> 01:46:54,879
Thank you my Creator!

867
01:46:55,400 --> 01:46:59,079
O the indomitable heart!

868
01:46:59,400 --> 01:47:06,439
The sturdy hands! Soldiers
of Kayi, valiants of Kayi!

869
01:47:06,600 --> 01:47:13,439
Hatlins of Kayi, we have
defeated the infidels thank Allah!

870
01:47:13,600 --> 01:47:15,279
Thank Allah!

871
01:47:15,440 --> 01:47:18,999
-We destroyed them thanks to Allah!
-Thank Allah!

872
01:47:19,200 --> 01:47:23,159
We believed, we went for it!

873
01:47:23,280 --> 01:47:29,519
Do not forget! Destiny loves effort!

874
01:47:30,600 --> 01:47:34,239
That is why my Creator has..

875
01:47:34,800 --> 01:47:37,479
..granted us Castle Kite.

876
01:47:37,720 --> 01:47:41,959
Everyone contributed for it!

877
01:47:45,640 --> 01:47:50,599
However, know this well.

878
01:47:51,680 --> 01:47:55,279
We are guests here.

879
01:47:56,200 --> 01:48:02,439
Castle Kite belongs to Gunduz Bey from now on.

880
01:48:03,440 --> 01:48:07,879
Osman Bey, you help a swordless man..

881
01:48:08,000 --> 01:48:13,559
..you feed the hungry, you
give the homeless a home..

882
01:48:14,000 --> 01:48:17,599
..your troubles, your cause is one with us.

883
01:48:17,960 --> 01:48:21,199
From now on, know that..

884
01:48:21,320 --> 01:48:26,159
..the target you point will be the target
of my alps and my arrowsi may you prevail!

885
01:48:26,280 --> 01:48:29,079
May you prevail.

886
01:48:29,840 --> 01:48:34,759
Alps! Valiants, Hatuns!

887
01:48:35,280 --> 01:48:39,839
For the World Order, for the great cause.

888
01:48:40,080 --> 01:48:42,719
..are you with me..

889
01:48:42,880 --> 01:48:46,039
..to fight with me until death?

890
01:48:46,160 --> 01:48:47,519
-We are with you!
-Are you with me?

891
01:48:47,520 --> 01:48:52,799
-We are with you!
-Are you with me?

892
01:48:52,920 --> 01:48:58,959
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

893
01:49:18,320 --> 01:49:19,599
Tisimus.

894
01:49:29,160 --> 01:49:31,999
You will stay here. You
will wait for the distraction..

895
01:49:32,120 --> 01:49:35,399
-..I will cause at night to escape.
-What will you do?

896
01:49:35,720 --> 01:49:37,260
I will kill Osman.

897
01:49:37,260 --> 01:49:40,279
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

898
01:49:52,560 --> 01:49:56,199
-Brother?
-Does your wound hurt, sister?

899
01:49:56,520 --> 01:50:00,199
No. It comes and goes time to time.

900
01:50:00,360 --> 01:50:05,359
Your life is more important than
everyone else my Gonca, do not forget this.

901
01:50:05,840 --> 01:50:09,639
You will not lunge in front of anyone from now on.

902
01:50:11,360 --> 01:50:16,679
-Are we allowed, my Shahzade?
-Come in Cerkutay.

903
01:50:21,120 --> 01:50:24,799
My Shahzade. Osman Bey sends word.

904
01:50:25,400 --> 01:50:27,719
He announced the conquest of Kite.

905
01:50:40,600 --> 01:50:44,039
Osman Bey used Atranos as the bait, huh?

906
01:50:44,800 --> 01:50:48,199
Good move, huh, Cerkutay?

907
01:50:53,400 --> 01:50:57,839
Osman Bey invites you and Gonca Hatun...

908
01:50:58,640 --> 01:51:01,799
...to the victory dinner in Kite.

909
01:51:03,400 --> 01:51:08,399
Alright then. Let's go share
Osman Bey's victory, huh?

910
01:51:09,120 --> 01:51:12,279
Come on. Prepare the horses, Cerkutay.

911
01:51:33,880 --> 01:51:37,119
Nightingales are singing with grief.

912
01:51:41,160 --> 01:51:45,399
Maybe it's its grief that
makes the sound so beautiful.

913
01:51:46,400 --> 01:51:51,599
Just like it's grief that matures
and completes a human,

914
01:51:52,160 --> 01:51:56,679
...nightingale's beautiful
voice is hidden in its grief.

915
01:51:57,120 --> 01:52:01,239
Your grief doesn't seem
less than the nightingale's.

916
01:52:02,000 --> 01:52:07,679
It has a matter with the rose.
What is the matter with you?

917
01:52:09,760 --> 01:52:14,039
My matter is not knowing.

918
01:52:14,400 --> 01:52:17,959
Not knowing the secret in Gonca.

919
01:52:18,480 --> 01:52:22,279
Is it this important to know?

920
01:52:24,760 --> 01:52:28,119
I was deceived, Dervish.

921
01:52:31,080 --> 01:52:36,119
I thought the thing on the
rosebud was the pure dewdrop,

922
01:52:36,400 --> 01:52:40,119
...but it turned out to be
coal tar, covering my love.

923
01:52:40,960 --> 01:52:46,279
But I don't know why she
covered my love with coal tar.

924
01:52:46,480 --> 01:52:52,039
With whose eyes do you look at the rosebud?

925
01:52:54,280 --> 01:52:59,919
You see the coal tar but do you see Layla in her?

926
01:53:03,280 --> 01:53:08,519
I can't know more than how she seems to me.

927
01:53:11,240 --> 01:53:15,119
Do you know Caliph Harun al-Rashid?

928
01:53:16,160 --> 01:53:23,199
He got curious about Layla who made Kays fall
in love and got her brought to his presence.

929
01:53:24,080 --> 01:53:28,439
Layla just felt shy and kept silent.

930
01:53:28,960 --> 01:53:32,919
Harun al-Rashid looked at her face for long.

931
01:53:33,240 --> 01:53:38,399
And he couldn't find the reason why Kays
fell in love. So he wanted to make her speak.

932
01:53:38,760 --> 01:53:43,479
He thought she might smile and
he could see the beauty in her face.

933
01:53:44,960 --> 01:53:49,999
She turned his eyes to Layla
and asked "Are you Layla?"

934
01:53:51,520 --> 01:53:57,359
"Yes", Layla said. "I'm
Layla, but you aren't Majnun.

935
01:53:57,960 --> 01:54:01,239
"You're looking at me with the
eyes with which you look at others.

936
01:54:01,480 --> 01:54:06,799
"If you don't look with Majnun's
eyes, you can't see Layla in me.'

937
01:54:07,400 --> 01:54:13,719
How does Majnun look? With wisdom and love.

938
01:54:14,080 --> 01:54:19,359
Those looking with love see
Layla. Those seeing Layla...

939
01:54:19,760 --> 01:54:26,999
...will see Allah. Can those who can't see
Allah can believe Allah is the Only God?

940
01:54:28,040 --> 01:54:30,959
-They can't.
-They can't.

941
01:54:31,240 --> 01:54:35,159
Remember. What makes people
believe Allah is the Only God...

942
01:54:35,320 --> 01:54:38,479
...isn't knowing but love.

943
01:54:40,680 --> 01:54:46,679
Eyes not looking with love will mean
nothing whether they know or not.

944
01:54:48,240 --> 01:54:52,999
They are always blind and can only see the flaws.

945
01:54:53,320 --> 01:54:58,439
Now you need to get rid of this blindness.

946
01:54:58,880 --> 01:55:03,359
-For your information.
-Well, Shahzade Alaaddin...

947
01:55:04,440 --> 01:55:08,079
You drew swords against
heathens and knocked them over.

948
01:55:09,680 --> 01:55:16,119
What about your mind? Can you
swing sword against your mind?

949
01:55:18,680 --> 01:55:22,559
Can you look with the eyes of Majnun?

950
01:55:27,040 --> 01:55:33,319
I destroyed his alps and siege
weapons. I had finished him!

951
01:55:34,080 --> 01:55:38,839
He hit me with my weapon. Fools!

952
01:55:40,560 --> 01:55:43,959
Castles and lands can be lost with a noble fight.

953
01:55:44,080 --> 01:55:48,559
I won't dishonor my fate
with the failure of fools!

954
01:55:50,320 --> 01:55:52,759
What now?

955
01:55:56,920 --> 01:56:00,119
Osman got a stronger hand by capturing Kite.

956
01:56:01,960 --> 01:56:05,399
But I will cut off his hand
before he even tastes it.

957
01:56:05,720 --> 01:56:11,479
A Turk's enemy is a Turk! I'll ruin
him and start my sultanate for sure!

958
01:56:17,800 --> 01:56:20,999
Welcome, Mehmed Bey. Gonca Hatun.

959
01:56:21,280 --> 01:56:24,279
May your victory be blessed, Aladdin Bey.

960
01:56:26,520 --> 01:56:31,159
-May it be holy.
-Let's go.

961
01:56:53,080 --> 01:56:58,599
What's the matter, Elcim
Hatun. You look so thoughtful.

962
01:57:02,120 --> 01:57:06,839
I was thinking about our
victory and Osman Bey's dream.

963
01:57:07,800 --> 01:57:12,519
How would it feel to become a
martyr for such a great dream?

964
01:57:15,520 --> 01:57:18,039
For this dream,

965
01:57:18,880 --> 01:57:22,879
...two tribe have to get
united. You know that, right?

966
01:57:28,840 --> 01:57:31,799
I know.

967
01:57:32,960 --> 01:57:36,519
You think you're making
the hardest choice for this.

968
01:57:37,440 --> 01:57:40,279
But that's not the case, Orhan Bey.

969
01:57:42,600 --> 01:57:47,159
Marrying a man whose heart
is beating for someone else...

970
01:57:48,600 --> 01:57:51,799
This is my test.

971
01:57:53,520 --> 01:57:59,359
This unity overwhelms your love and my pride.

972
01:58:03,520 --> 01:58:09,439
Elcim Hatun, I didn't want this.

973
01:58:11,960 --> 01:58:15,519
I ignored my pride and accepted it.

974
01:58:18,120 --> 01:58:21,479
Now it's up to you.

975
01:58:31,080 --> 01:58:37,159
It's up to me now, huh? It's up to me.

976
01:58:50,600 --> 01:58:55,119
Attention! Osman Bey!

977
01:59:26,840 --> 01:59:30,519
-Selamun aleykum.
-Ve aleykum selam.

978
01:59:30,920 --> 01:59:35,319
Welcome. Welcome.

979
01:59:40,680 --> 01:59:44,919
May your conquest be blessed, Osman Bey.

980
01:59:45,040 --> 01:59:47,159
Thank you. Thank you.

981
01:59:47,240 --> 01:59:52,679
-May your conquest be blessed, Osman Bey!
-Thank you, beys.

982
01:59:54,600 --> 01:59:58,879
Thank you. Sit down.

983
02:00:11,400 --> 02:00:17,239
The castle of Kite is the first of our conquests.

984
02:00:18,360 --> 02:00:22,999
After this, we will march to Atranos.

985
02:00:23,720 --> 02:00:27,279
And if Allah permits, after we take Atranos,

986
02:00:27,800 --> 02:00:33,599
...we will capture Bursa, Iznik and Geyve.

987
02:00:34,080 --> 02:00:39,639
If Allah permits, we will take
one more step towards them.

988
02:00:40,240 --> 02:00:44,719
Well... It was tough.

989
02:00:45,160 --> 02:00:48,719
So tough.

990
02:00:51,760 --> 02:00:55,879
But those who helped us in tough times...

991
02:00:57,280 --> 02:01:00,359
...will certainly be rewarded.

992
02:01:00,800 --> 02:01:04,039
Everybody hear this well!

993
02:01:04,880 --> 02:01:08,799
The castle of Kite and the lands around it...

994
02:01:10,000 --> 02:01:14,239
...belong to Gunduz Bey now.

995
02:01:21,280 --> 02:01:24,239
Boran.

996
02:01:37,520 --> 02:01:41,679
May Allah allow you to
rule with righteously, I hope.

997
02:01:41,960 --> 02:01:44,679
-If Allah permits.
-Amen.

998
02:01:44,960 --> 02:01:49,239
Come on now. In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

999
02:01:50,960 --> 02:01:54,839
You may start, enjoy.

1000
02:01:55,160 --> 02:01:57,919
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

1001
02:02:13,520 --> 02:02:16,279
Mehmed Bey.

1002
02:02:19,080 --> 02:02:21,439
You kept your father's word..

1003
02:02:21,880 --> 02:02:26,279
..and stood behind us. May you prevail.

1004
02:02:26,920 --> 02:02:32,039
From now on, we will not distinguish you.

1005
02:02:32,320 --> 02:02:34,639
Thank you.

1006
02:02:37,280 --> 02:02:43,399
My daughter Gonca. You
saved my son Alaeddin's life.

1007
02:02:44,840 --> 02:02:49,559
May you prevail. That is why, from now on..

1008
02:02:50,120 --> 02:02:53,639
..I will see you as my daughter.

1009
02:02:58,280 --> 02:03:01,999
Everyone shall know as such.

1010
02:03:02,120 --> 02:03:05,359
Anyone would've done the same, Osman Bey.

1011
02:03:07,760 --> 02:03:11,079
You can not put a price on life, my daughter.

1012
02:03:11,320 --> 02:03:14,559
No one would've done the same.

1013
02:03:16,360 --> 02:03:21,279
We owe you a life.

1014
02:03:25,080 --> 02:03:31,199
My Gonca is courageous.
She did what needed to be done.

1015
02:03:33,440 --> 02:03:36,439
That is why we stood behind you.

1016
02:03:36,720 --> 02:03:41,119
What make us prevail
against the enemy, is the heart.

1017
02:03:41,880 --> 02:03:48,239
Whenever you call for war, Garmiyanid Mehmed Bey
will be by your side always.

1018
02:03:48,400 --> 02:03:52,759
Thank you.

1019
02:03:54,040 --> 02:03:56,279
Come on then.

1020
02:03:56,720 --> 02:04:03,999
Send word to Cerkutay. I forgive him.

1021
02:04:05,200 --> 02:04:11,759
He can be with us if he wants or
stay on his duty by Garmiyanids.

1022
02:04:16,440 --> 02:04:18,999
Now it is time for Solgur Aga.

1023
02:04:19,120 --> 02:04:23,359
-My Bey.
-Solgur Aga.

1024
02:04:23,760 --> 02:04:27,959
Your contribution in the conquest is big,
that is why your share will be big also.

1025
02:04:28,520 --> 02:04:33,079
You will make new outposts at the borders.

1026
02:04:34,040 --> 02:04:37,719
You will control every caravan and those who pass.

1027
02:04:37,920 --> 02:04:42,559
I am honor to have this duty,
my Bey. As you command.

1028
02:04:42,720 --> 02:04:47,279
May you prevail.

1029
02:04:49,800 --> 02:04:54,399
Health to your hands, Malhun
Hatun. We became a burden to you.

1030
02:04:55,360 --> 02:05:00,719
Astaghfurillah.
You are welcomed.

1031
02:05:01,000 --> 02:05:04,559
As long as we are friends, that is.

1032
02:05:05,760 --> 02:05:10,599
Malhun Hatun. As a token of our friendship..

1033
02:05:12,640 --> 02:05:16,199
..I wrote a letter to The Emperor.

1034
02:05:19,160 --> 02:05:21,799
If you can send it..

1035
02:05:21,920 --> 02:05:25,679
..he will see Imren Tegin's true side and help us.

1036
02:05:26,360 --> 02:05:32,079
Because Osman Bey won't be able
to defeat Imren Tegin when he is alone.

1037
02:05:33,520 --> 02:05:38,879
You are very considerate, Olivia. But don't worry.

1038
02:05:39,120 --> 02:05:44,879
Osman Bey will defeat Imren soon.

1039
02:05:50,120 --> 02:05:52,759
Mother! I have good news!

1040
02:05:52,960 --> 02:05:55,479
I brought news from Osman Bey!

1041
02:05:55,600 --> 02:06:00,559
Kite is now the property of Kayi!

1042
02:06:03,360 --> 02:06:07,919
Thanks to my Allah!

1043
02:06:17,000 --> 02:06:22,879
The properties are taken.
The duties are given.

1044
02:06:23,880 --> 02:06:27,039
Boran... -My Bey...

1045
02:06:27,400 --> 02:06:29,479
Play your qopuz.

1046
02:06:30,120 --> 02:06:32,399
Yes my Bey.

1047
02:06:38,280 --> 02:06:40,199
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

1048
02:06:53,920 --> 02:06:57,959
When he reached the age of twenty...

1049
02:06:58,400 --> 02:07:02,959
...he received good news in his blessed dream.

1050
02:07:03,120 --> 02:07:07,039
Against the tyrants...

1051
02:07:07,440 --> 02:07:11,639
...he is the hidden giant, Osman Bey.

1052
02:07:12,040 --> 02:07:16,119
He carries the blood of Edebal

1053
02:07:16,520 --> 02:07:20,559
...to bring pain upon the heathens.

1054
02:07:21,080 --> 02:07:25,599
He is the pride of Ertugrul Ghazi...

1055
02:07:25,720 --> 02:07:30,439
...he is a warrior like no other, Osman Bey.

1056
02:07:34,800 --> 02:07:38,719
He made such enemies kneel..

1057
02:07:38,920 --> 02:07:46,119
He rode the horses under the open skies...

1058
02:07:46,360 --> 02:07:50,839
...and struck down the armies of tyrants.

1059
02:07:51,040 --> 02:07:54,399
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

1060
02:07:55,640 --> 02:07:59,959
He struck down the armies of tyrants.

1061
02:08:00,200 --> 02:08:04,559
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

1062
02:08:22,960 --> 02:08:27,039
With the grey maned horses..

1063
02:08:27,440 --> 02:08:31,599
With good armor and sharp swords...

1064
02:08:32,120 --> 02:08:35,999
With warriors and brave hearts...

1065
02:08:36,680 --> 02:08:40,999
...he wrote an epic, Osman Bey.

1066
02:08:41,320 --> 02:08:45,559
When the poor people cried out in pain...

1067
02:08:45,800 --> 02:08:49,719
He shook the earth with his call...

1068
02:08:50,560 --> 02:08:54,799
...to from a state...

1069
02:08:54,960 --> 02:09:00,279
...and become a home for the innocent.

1070
02:09:04,480 --> 02:09:08,439
He made such enemies kneel.

1071
02:09:11,400 --> 02:09:15,879
He rode the horses under the open skies...

1072
02:09:16,040 --> 02:09:20,519
...and struck down the armies of tyrants.

1073
02:09:20,840 --> 02:09:25,359
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

1074
02:09:25,480 --> 02:09:29,679
He struck down the armies of tyrants.

1075
02:09:29,960 --> 02:09:32,879
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.
-Osman Bey!

1076
02:09:33,320 --> 02:09:36,279
Father! -Gunduz Bey

1077
02:09:39,360 --> 02:09:43,439
Take him! Ayaz! -Gunduz Bey!

1078
02:09:43,600 --> 02:09:46,879
Gunduz Bey! Gunduz Bey!

1079
02:09:47,040 --> 02:09:50,839
Alaeddin! Check his wound!

1080
02:09:53,360 --> 02:09:57,119
Check everywhere in the castle!
Burn every place if necessary!

1081
02:09:57,240 --> 02:09:59,799
I don't want a single crusader here! Go!

1082
02:09:59,920 --> 02:10:03,399
Bring warm water! Heat a sword, come on!

1083
02:10:05,480 --> 02:10:07,999
Gunduz Bey!

1084
02:10:08,960 --> 02:10:11,279
Give it to me.

1085
02:10:12,720 --> 02:10:14,999
Don't worry. You'll be alright.

1086
02:10:15,160 --> 02:10:17,599
Hang on! Hang on!

1087
02:10:17,880 --> 02:10:21,799
-Hang on!
-Allah lets us live...

1088
02:10:22,080 --> 02:10:24,719
...and Allah makes us die.

1089
02:10:24,920 --> 02:10:27,479
I am dying here now.

1090
02:10:27,600 --> 02:10:31,399
It is the decision of Allah... But...

1091
02:10:31,680 --> 02:10:35,079
...promise me, Osman Bey.

1092
02:10:35,200 --> 02:10:37,919
Tell me! -I don't..

1093
02:10:38,280 --> 02:10:42,239
..have a son.

1094
02:10:42,880 --> 02:10:46,359
For me to find peace..

1095
02:10:47,360 --> 02:10:52,879
...and for the well-being of the state and Kayi...

1096
02:10:53,760 --> 02:10:58,919
...for the sake of your
grandmother Hayme mother...

1097
02:11:00,040 --> 02:11:03,399
...allow Elcim
Hatun and your son..

1098
02:11:03,720 --> 02:11:07,319
...Shahzade Orhan...

1099
02:11:08,160 --> 02:11:13,759
...to get married. -Father...

1100
02:11:28,120 --> 02:11:32,959
Gunduz Bey, stop.. Wait...

1101
02:11:36,440 --> 02:11:38,839
You will see...

1102
02:11:39,960 --> 02:11:44,719
...the wedding of your daughter Elcim Hatun.

1103
02:11:46,040 --> 02:11:49,279
Your daughter Elcim Hatun...

1104
02:11:54,800 --> 02:11:59,679
...will marry Orhan for the union...

1105
02:12:00,720 --> 02:12:04,159
...of Kayis.

1106
02:12:14,080 --> 02:12:20,479
Hayme mother also wanted to unite
Kayi tribe's people who parted their ways.

1107
02:12:22,160 --> 02:12:27,439
-With Allah's consent, we will be able to do this.
-If Allah permits.

1108
02:12:28,600 --> 02:12:31,719
You will see it.

1109
02:12:31,840 --> 02:12:37,919
We will organize such a wedding that,
every Turkmen tribe will stand behind us!

1110
02:12:40,360 --> 02:12:43,159
But... you will also stand behind me.

1111
02:12:43,400 --> 02:12:46,799
You will fight with me! Don't worry...

1112
02:12:47,040 --> 02:12:49,639
...you will survive.

1113
02:12:49,960 --> 02:12:51,119
But....

1114
02:12:52,680 --> 02:12:56,399
We will not let anyone who
stands against us survive.

1115
02:12:57,374 --> 02:13:08,084
Visit turkision.com for more!